# =============================================================================
# RTL-to-GDSII AI Automation - Environment Variables
# Copy this file to .env and insert your free API keys:
#   cp .env.example .env
# =============================================================================

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. CEREBRAS CLOUD (HIGHEST PRIORITY - 1,000,000 FREE TOKENS/DAY PER ACCOUNT)
# Ultra-fast 2,000 tok/s on Wafer-Scale Engine (No credit card needed)
# Signup: https://cloud.cerebras.ai
